  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "During the day-long fight inside years flow execution formation, Xia Cha shouts and whips storm winds and crackling lightning into a huge fan in her hands. She unleashes Immortal killer move Summer Fan and waves the fan: the formation core where Fang Yuan stands breaks and exposes him, and Bai Ning Bing’s Bai Xiang shatters under the impact. After three waves the formation is near collapse, Fang Yuan and his side are injured, and the dimmed fan lights again for another strike. When Fang Yuan unleashes dream realms, Xia Cha waves her fan again, but that powerful immortal killer move is useless and completely ineffective against them.",
      "chapters": [
        1603
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xia_cha",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_bai_ning_bing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the same three waves, Xia Cha waves toward her right; Lady White Rabbit cannot dodge, her formation core shatters, and her body bursts, killing her. Bai Ning Bing later notes that Lady White Rabbit died in that battle.",
      "chapters": [
        1603
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "a-fatal-formation-core-break",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lady_white_rabbit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Miao Yin mourns her and recalls that Summer Fan struck before she could react.",
      "chapters": [
        1605
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "recalled-as-a-sudden-strike",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_miao_yin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After soul searching Xia Cha, Fang Yuan lists her battle set as spring scissors, summer fan, autumn perception, and winter coat, involving Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter Immortal Gu. Spring scissors and summer fan are extremely ferocious and fully display rank eight might. Spring and Summer Immortal Gu are both rank eight and need rank eight immortal essence to activate.",
      "chapters": [
        1617
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "seasonal-battle-set",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_spring_scissors",
        "move_winter_coat",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Facing Southern Border Gu Immortals, Fang Yuan’s aura rises to rank eight; he folds his hands into a fan shape and casts Summer Fan after Spring Scissors. Spring scissors suppress Jun Shen Guang while summer fan in his hand waves rapidly and blocks the Southern Border immortals’ killer moves, and Xia clan rank sevens recognize Lady Xia Cha’s methods.",
      "chapters": [
        1624
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fang-yuans-casts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_jun_shen_guang",
        "fac_xia_clan"
      ]
    }
  ],
